F8r switching to Now: median GTK-thread CPU recorded and no worse than 2.5.0's 16.9 ms + 25% = 21.1 ms (median of 10, @@ ms)
F8r opening Mix: median GTK-thread CPU recorded and no worse than 2.5.0's 12.9 ms + 25% = 16.1 ms (median of 10, @@ ms)
